{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Travel the seas<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828490/extras/travel.gif?t=1743519658\" />Trade over 20 goods<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828490/extras/trading.gif?t=1743519658\" />Build new businesses<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828490/extras/building.gif?t=1743519658\" />Upgrade your ships<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828490/extras/upgrades.gif?t=1743519658\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to High Seas, High Profits! A game about putting on the dusty pants of a medieval capitalist, entrusting drunk sailors with trading your beer and enforcing the almost random desires of whimsy mayors who think famine is kinda bad, but throwing a harvest celebration is crucial!<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're busy, let's get down to business:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> discover the cities on your map and the bonuses that they offer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> trade between cities and build wealth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> buy old dusty ships or build your very own new and shiny ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> learn about prices and set up trading routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> build production businesses or enter auctions for city owned shops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> find new captains with awesome traits, or train the ones you have into... sucking less</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> engage with the other traders, race them through the cities, help them out or work towards bankrupting them and taking over their business</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> fight pirates, run away or just.. befriend them, for a chance at treasure and rare ship improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> enjoy chill, turn based gameplay or fast pace RTS and switch between the 2 at any time!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Getting my sea legs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2828490/1e8044699be23a4de1fc5d11ca480a47ea4d25c9.jpg"},{"name":"Getting on the treadmill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2828490/760c9acaf1a3468c4a9b844b811c0b6a4816c323.jpg"},{"name":"Getting the hang of it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2828490/2e81f620dbc4ef91655edb81f236e52f02bf1f6e.jpg"},{"name":"Smells like monopoly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2828490/6d52a4ccef6034784afd8fdd808178077666fbfe.jpg"},{"name":"Map curious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2828490/3a9648ba058c95e2d010d5d9554cadf19441a338.jpg"},{"name":"Basically Magellan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2828490/556aabb13f4285fedf2d5d03d70e8d8bb01453bb.jpg"},{"name":"Wood you kindly?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2828490/2b74681a2081e01f77216b678479c8f445faa095.jpg"},{"name":"Duct tape and dreams","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2828490/426af8bc044fb28720096bcf5fdafe5d500a8353.jpg"},{"name":"Naval armada","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2828490/c9bf8caabb57961fea4cd64b069ddeb52bd43081.jpg"},{"name":"Complete dominance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2828490/421d9aae99887ed2e417a9d66968c804392d1dd1.jpg"}],"total":44},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2828490?t=1743519658","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2828490?t=1743519658","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828490/ff5998d3552c294d7b65ce65dd7a4fc63972df10/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743519658","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828490/ff5998d3552c294d7b65ce65dd7a4fc63972df10/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743519658","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3153540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Switch between RTS and TBS at any time<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828490/extras/rts-tbs.gif?t=1743519658\" />Replace captains<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828490/extras/captain-replace.gif?t=1743519658\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Travel the seas<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828490/extras/travel.gif?t=1743519658\" />Trade over 20 goods<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828490/extras/trading.gif?t=1743519658\" />Build new businesses<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828490/extras/building.gif?t=1743519658\" />Upgrade your ships<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828490/extras/upgrades.gif?t=1743519658\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to High Seas, High Profits! A game about putting on the dusty pants of a medieval capitalist, entrusting drunk sailors with trading your beer and enforcing the almost random desires of whimsy mayors who think famine is kinda bad, but throwing a harvest celebration is crucial!<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're busy, let's get down to business:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> discover the cities on your map and the bonuses that they offer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> trade between cities and build wealth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> buy old dusty ships or build your very own new and shiny ones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> learn about prices and set up trading routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> build production businesses or enter auctions for city owned shops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> find new captains with awesome traits, or train the ones you have into... sucking less</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> engage with the other traders, race them through the cities, help them out or work towards bankrupting them and taking over their business</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> fight pirates, run away or just.. befriend them, for a chance at treasure and rare ship improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> enjoy chill, turn based gameplay or fast pace RTS and switch between the 2 at any time!</p></li></ul>","developers":["lexy.zip"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2828490/header.jpg?t=1743519658","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 14<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4460<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 750 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18 / Mint<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 5600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 3050 Ti<br></li>